## Command

```shell
biome format --write file.md special/file.md
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "overrides": [
    {
      "includes": ["special/**"],
      "markdown": {
        "formatter": {
          "quoteStyle": "single"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## `file.md`

```md
[Biome](https://biomejs.dev "title")

```

## `special/file.md`

```md
[Biome](https://biomejs.dev 'title')

```

